Package: rmux
Version: 1.0.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.10), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.2), libvte-2.91-gtk4-0
Maintainer: rmux Team <info@rmux.dev>
Description: Fast, simple, modern terminal for Linux
 Pure Rust terminal emulator built on GTK4, libadwaita and VTE.
 Features multiple workspaces, split panes, live themes and a top-bar
 indicator with hide-to-tray.
